                "message": "Normalize source paths for included .pxi files\n\nDerive include descriptions from the including source or include search\nroot. This avoids build directory paths in generated code. Honor explicit\nlogical names for sources inside the working directory as well.\n\nOnly the source file name that ends up in a built extension module is\nchanged here; paths for file access and diagnostics are kept the same.\n\nDiffoscope output comparing strings in an extension module in SciPy\nfrom two wheel builds with different build-directory depths:\n\n```diff\n-../scipy/cluster/hierarchy/_structures.pxi\n+../../../scipy/cluster/hierarchy/_structures.pxi\n```\n\nAfter this change, both now use `scipy/cluster/hierarchy/_structures.pxi`.",
